OL,4,CVictim in murder probe named by police 
OL,5,GA woman who was found dead in a        
OL,6,Gproperty in Wisbech has been named by  
OL,7,Gpolice as Vera Jaunzeme.               
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Police said it was      
OL,10,Fcalled to Alexandra Road, Wisbech, at  
OL,11,Fabout 21:50 GMT on Saturday, to        
OL,12,Freports that the body of the 61-year-  
OL,13,Fold had been discovered.               
OL,15,FThe force said a 62-year-old man was   
OL,16,Farrested on suspicion of murder and    
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital where he remained.   
OL,18,FPolice said he would be taken into     
OL,19,Fcustody on his discharge.              
OL,21,FA post-mortem examination is due to    
OL,22,Ftake place on Thursday.           G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
