OL,4,CWoman faces assisted suicide charge    
OL,5,Cover mum's death                       
OL,6,GA woman has been charged with          
OL,7,Gassisting the suicide of her 70-year-  
OL,8,Gold mother who died from a drug        
OL,9,Goverdose.                              
OL,11,FEmma Nightingale, 37, has been charged 
OL,12,Fwith "providing tablets" that ended    
OL,13,Fthe life of Lorna Nightingale, in      
OL,14,FDecember 2025.                         
OL,16,FIn an interview with the media in      
OL,17,FAugust, Emma, of Lowestoft, Suffolk,   
OL,18,Fsaid her mother had chronic kidney     
OL,19,Fdisease, severe dental problems, and   
OL,20,Fcataracts affecting both eyes.         
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
