OL,4,CBrit winners Jungle first to headline  
OL,5,CLatitude 2027                          
OL,6,GBrit Award winning soul band Jungle    
OL,7,Gare the first to be announced as       
OL,8,Gheadliners for the 2027 Latitude       
OL,9,GFestival.                              
OL,11,FThe festival, which is back for its    
OL,12,F21st year, will take place from 22 to  
OL,13,F25 July at Henham Park, near Southwold 
OL,14,Fin Suffolk.                            
OL,16,FJungle's headline slot has been        
OL,17,Fdescribed as a "full circle moment"    
OL,18,Fafter the band, known for hits         
OL,19,Fincluding Back on 74 and Volcano, made 
OL,20,Ftheir Latitude debut in 2014.          
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
